      "description": "\"Mutable Trees\" is a groundbreaking generative art collection that brings Bitcoin's evolution to vibrant life. Each unique tree in this series is inscribed on Bitcoin, growing and transforming in perfect synchronization with Bitcoin's block height. As new blocks are mined and the blockchain extends, these digital arbors flourish, their growth patterns determined by the very data of Bitcoin itself.Rooted at specific Bitcoin block heights, yet ever-changing, these digital saplings embody the paradox of Bitcoin's technology—an immutable ledger producing dynamic, evolving art. With each new block, the trees' branches reach higher, creating a mesmerizing visual representation of Bitcoin's ongoing story.Step into this digital forest with Mutable Trees—where Bitcoin's block height becomes nature's growth rings, and every mined block paints new leaves on the canvas of Bitcoin's ever-expanding universe.",
